      "finding": "Factor, weight, and update are independent ready/valid paths and triple overlap is both structurally present and covered. Because every nonzero descriptor consumes at least one issue round, one-request/cycle factor and weight throughput cannot exceed the update bottleneck after fill. The clean recurrence is therefore defensible for the stated fixed-latency, in-order contract.",
