      "finding": "The all-255 synthetic case overstates the frozen-trace RTL recurrence ratio and must remain local validation. Fixed two-cycle factor/weight latency is directly checked, but only the in-order fixed-latency contract is supported; legal variable-latency response reordering is not tested.",
      "id": "A2_SYNTHETIC_MASK_AND_RESPONSE_MODEL",
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "verdict": "RATIO_BIASED_BUT_FINAL_GATE_USES_FROZEN_TRACE"
    },
